config RUST_NSPROXY
	bool "Rust namespace-transition source proposal (not admitted)"
	depends on RUST && BROKEN
	default n
	help
	  Inactive continuation of the existing namespace-transition Rust.
	  Configured native types, ABI/CFI, init metadata, ownership and runtime
	  behavior remain unqualified. Keep this disabled.
